{"id":8640,"date":"2024-05-19T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-05-19T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8640"},"modified":"2026-05-27T07:19:17","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T07:19:17","slug":"remodel-your-home-for-less-than-10000","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/remodel-your-home-for-less-than-10000\/","title":{"rendered":"Remodel Your Home for Less Than $10,000"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This sounds unbelievable, too good to be true right ? Well here is the truth. Complexity, materials, and timeline play a role. If you are looking to hire a general contractor because you are not willing to do the hard manual labor of remodeling your home yourself, sacrificing your social life, and dealing with your own mistakes because of inexperience. Here are some very rough numbers of the OVERALL PROJECT COSTS:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Basic Kitchen Remodel: $30,000 &#8211; $65,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Basic Bathroom Remodel: $6,000 &#8211; $30,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Addition: $60,000 &#8211; $150,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Full Home Remodel: $150,000 &#8211; $380,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However the good news is here are some very rough numbers of CASH DOWN you would need in order to do a home remodel based on scope:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Basic Kitchen Remodel: $10,000 &#8211; $20,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Basic Bathroom Remodel: $3,000 &#8211; $10,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Addition: $20,000 &#8211; $50,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Full Home Remodel: $50,000 &#8211; $80,000<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Harris &amp; Sons, we are happy to say we have great financing options to make your dream home a reality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">BUT, if you are willing and able then remodeling your home doesn&#8217;t have to cost this much. With a little elbow grease and a few simple tools, you can save money and improve your living space for less than $10,000. Whether you live in Portland, OR, Gresham, OR, or Tigard, OR, budget-friendly home updates are within your reach. In this guide, we&#8217;ll explore economical home improvement strategies to help you achieve a cost-effective home renovation without breaking the bank.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/woman-with-dog-renovating-house-2023-11-27-04-49-21-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"A woman doing wall paint\" class=\"wp-image-8643\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do the Work Yourself<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the best ways to save money on home remodeling is to do the work yourself. DIY projects can significantly cut down on labor costs, making a budget-conscious remodeling effort more feasible, but they won&#8217;t save you time and effort. Here are some areas where you can take charge:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kitchen Remodel<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Revamping your kitchen can be done on a shoestring budget. Start by painting the cabinets instead of replacing them. A fresh coat of paint can make a world of difference. Replace old hardware with modern, affordable options found at discount stores. Install a new backsplash using peel-and-stick tiles, which are both inexpensive and easy to apply.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bathroom Upgrade<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For a budget home remodel in the bathroom, consider updating fixtures and fittings. Swap out old faucets and showerheads for new, energy-efficient models. Re-grout tiles to refresh the look of your bathroom. You can also paint the walls or install a new vanity to give the space a modern touch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Living Room Makeover<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the living room, inexpensive home upgrades can include new lighting fixtures, which can transform the ambiance of the room. Rearrange furniture or add a fresh coat of paint to the walls. DIY shelving units can provide both functionality and style without a hefty price tag.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bedroom Refresh<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Give your bedroom a fresh look by updating the linens and curtains. Adding a new headboard, which you can build yourself, can also make a significant impact. Consider installing new lighting or a ceiling fan to enhance both comfort and style.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Save Money with Smart Strategies<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Use Online Inspiration<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Online platforms like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.houzz.com\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.houzz.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Houzz<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pinterest<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube <\/a>are treasure troves of frugal home improvement ideas. You can find tutorials on everything from creating custom shelving to installing new flooring. These resources provide step-by-step guides that can help you tackle projects you might have thought were beyond your capabilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buy Materials Wisely<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Purchase materials from discount stores or look for sales at big-box retailers. Consider reclaimed or repurposed materials for a unique, eco-friendly touch. Thrift stores and Habitat for Humanity ReStores often have great deals on gently used items like doors, windows, and fixtures.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DIY Paint and Countertops<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can create custom paint colors by mixing different shades. This not only saves money but also allows you to achieve a unique look. For countertops, consider alternatives like concrete blocks or repurposing old doors. These options can provide a stylish and durable surface at a fraction of the cost of traditional materials.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/man-painting-a-room-white-on-a-home-remodel-2023-11-27-05-32-15-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"A man doing the wall paint\" class=\"wp-image-8644\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Energy-Efficient Updates<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Investing in energy-efficient upgrades can save you money in the long run. Install energy-efficient windows, replace old light bulbs with LED ones, and seal any drafts around doors and windows to improve your home&#8217;s insulation. These small changes can significantly reduce your utility bills over time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reach Out to Friends and Family<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your network can be your greatest asset in a budget-friendly home update. Friends and family members with skills in trades like carpentry, plumbing, or electrical work can provide invaluable help. They might be willing to lend a hand for free or for a nominal fee, significantly reducing your labor costs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keep a Tight Budget<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Managing your budget is crucial to ensuring your project stays on track financially. Here are some cost-cutting renovation tips:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan Ahead<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before you start, calculate all potential costs, including materials, labor, permits, and finishes. Having a detailed budget will help you avoid unexpected expenses. Make it your mission to stay under budget, treating it as a challenge to spend less than you initially planned.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prioritize Spending<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Focus on high-impact areas that will give you the most significant return on your investment. For example, updating the kitchen and bathrooms often adds the most value to a home. Allocate funds to these areas first and consider lower-cost updates for other parts of the house.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/apartment-professional-renovation-2023-11-27-05-23-34-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Home renovation\" class=\"wp-image-8646\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Track Expenses<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Keep detailed records of all your expenditures. This will help you stay aware of your spending and make adjustments if necessary. Regularly review your budget to ensure you\u2019re not overspending in any category.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Use Cost-Effective Solutions<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Look for budget-friendly renovation plans that offer maximum impact for minimal cost. For instance, instead of replacing old floors, you might refinish them. Opt for laminate or vinyl flooring, which can mimic the look of more expensive materials at a fraction of the price.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Local Insights and Resources<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Living in areas like Bend, OR, or Beaverton, OR, offers unique opportunities for finding local resources and services that can help you save money. Many communities have local suppliers who offer competitive prices on materials and supplies. Additionally, local contractors might be more willing to negotiate prices or offer discounts to their neighbors. And one of these contractors is <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Budget-Friendly Renovation Ideas<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Paint It Fresh<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A fresh coat of paint is one of the most cost-effective ways to transform any space. Choose neutral colors for a modern, cohesive look that appeals to a wide range of tastes. Painting is a DIY-friendly task that can be completed over a weekend, making it perfect for budget-conscious homeowners.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Update Fixtures and Hardware<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Swapping out old fixtures and hardware can give your home a modern update without a hefty price tag. Look for sales on faucets, cabinet handles, and light fixtures. These small changes can make a big difference in the overall aesthetic of your home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/mid-adults-couple-renovating-furniture-indoors-at-2023-11-27-05-05-45-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Home renovation setup\" class=\"wp-image-8647\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Add Crown Molding<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Crown molding adds a touch of elegance to any room. While it might look expensive, you can install it yourself with some basic tools and a bit of patience. Choose lightweight materials like foam molding, which is easier to work with and more affordable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve Curb Appeal<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enhancing your home&#8217;s curb appeal doesn&#8217;t have to be expensive. Simple updates like painting the front door, planting new flowers, or adding a new mailbox can make your home more inviting. These projects are typically low-cost and can be completed in a day or two.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Install New Flooring<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your budget allows, consider updating your flooring. Laminate and vinyl flooring are affordable options that mimic the look of hardwood or tile. These materials are durable, easy to install, and perfect for high-traffic areas like kitchens and living rooms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Remodeling your home for less than $10,000 is challenging but achievable, particularly if you focus on smaller projects and are prepared to invest significant time and effort into DIY work. This budget allows for meaningful upgrades and improvements, but it requires a willingness to sacrifice personal time and social life, as well as an acceptance of the learning curve that comes with manual labor. By taking on tasks yourself, you can stretch your dollars further and make significant changes to your living space.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However, it&#8217;s important to recognize the limitations of a $10,000 budget. Larger renovations and professional-grade finishes often fall outside this range, particularly when considering the value of your time and potential for mistakes. For those who prefer a more efficient and expertly executed renovation, hiring a professional local contractor like <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/services\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/services\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> is a smart choice. With over 200 positive customer reviews, Harris &amp; Sons offers competitive pricing and high-quality craftsmanship, ensuring your project is completed to the highest standards.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While DIY projects can be cost-effective, they often extend timelines and increase the likelihood of errors, which can be costly to fix. <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">Professional contractors<\/a> bring expertise, efficiency, and a polished finish to your renovation, albeit at a higher cost. By choosing Harris &amp; Sons, you invest in peace of mind, knowing that your renovation will be handled with professionalism and care.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In conclusion, remodeling your home for under $10,000 is possible with dedication and hard work on smaller projects. But with a reasonable down payment, for a seamless, high-quality renovation, <a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">consider hiring Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>. Our proven track record and excellent customer satisfaction make us a reliable choice for bringing your dream home to life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy remodeling!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>This sounds unbelievable, too good to be true right ? Well here is the truth. Complexity, materials, and timeline play a role. If you are looking to hire a general contractor because you are not willing to do the hard manual labor of remodeling your home yourself, sacrificing your social life, and dealing with your [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8642,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[33,30,32],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-8640","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-remodeling-tips","category-bathroom-resources","category-kitchen-resources"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8640","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8640"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8640\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16309,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8640\/revisions\/16309"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8640"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8640"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8640"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}